ENCODINGS
=========

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/font/encodings.git
tag    = encodings-1.1.0
commit = a7e63704951b95351096c1d96808d48d0fb7e0a8
date   = 2024-03-02

tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh installs the .enc files (and large/) in
/usr/local/share/fonts/encodings and writes their encodings.dir from each
file's STARTENCODING name, as mkfontscale would (mkfontscale is not built).
Nothing is written into the submodule.

